[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909089966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106790#issuecomment-2909089966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106790","id":2909089966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tZTCu","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T09:43:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T09:55:01Z","body":"Cool stuff! I spent days trying to find some fix for that issue with the linked list approach in #91006, with various invocations of `GDScriptLanguage::exit_function()`, but just found myself with more cryptic crashes.\r\n\r\nI can't say I understand all the ins-and-outs of this alternative approach with the coroutine signal handover, so I'll leave that for the GDScript people to review, but seeing as how all the unit tests pass and whatnot, this looks promising.\r\n\r\nYou'll probably want to change the documentation of the `debug/settings/gdscript/always_track_call_stacks` project setting while you're at it:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/45fc515ae3574e9c1f9deacaa6960dec68a7d38b/doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml#L652-L656\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just realized you removed the `track_call_stack` check from `GDScriptLanguage::enter_function` and `GDScriptLanguage::exit_function`, so I guess this project setting is in a bit of a weird state at the moment, where the call stacks are in fact always tracked regardless of build, but `OPCODE_LINE` won't always be used, so you won't always have accurate line numbers?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909089966/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909143214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106790#issuecomment-2909143214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106790","id":2909143214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tZgCu","user":{"login":"limbonaut","id":2766569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjY1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2766569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut","html_url":"https://github.com/limbonaut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T10:00:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T10:11:19Z","body":"> I just realized you removed the `track_call_stack` check from `GDScriptLanguage::enter_function` and `GDScriptLanguage::exit_function`\r\n\r\nOh, I probably removed that check by accident, as I was thinking of removing the option altogether, but it might be too controversial a change. I'm not sure how open the team is to enabling script traces for all builds by default.\r\n\r\nUPDATE:\r\nFixed it -- the checks are back.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909143214/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909306312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106790#issuecomment-2909306312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106790","id":2909306312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6taH3I","user":{"login":"limbonaut","id":2766569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjY1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2766569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut","html_url":"https://github.com/limbonaut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T10:54:35Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T10:54:35Z","body":"Just realized, since `CallLevel` now resides on the `call()` stack and is 48 bytes, its memory cost is incurred regardless of whether the `track_call_stack` option is enabled. Although the total memory used depends on the actual GDScript call stack size rather than the maximum. The option still affects whether the `OPCODE_LINE` instructions are added.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909306312/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909600216","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106790#issuecomment-2909600216","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106790","id":2909600216,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tbPnY","user":{"login":"limbonaut","id":2766569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjY1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2766569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut","html_url":"https://github.com/limbonaut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/limbonaut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T12:36:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T14:56:48Z","body":"I found an issue with this implementation. Since I removed `GDFunctionState::first_state`, there's nothing keeping `first_state` alive because it's a RefCounted, so the \"completed\" signal sometimes gets called on a freed instance of `GDFunctionState`. I'll make adjustments.\r\n\r\nUPDATE: Done.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909600216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3025807816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106790#issuecomment-3025807816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106790","id":3025807816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60WinI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T23:04:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T23:04:45Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3025807816/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]